      <title>12 Ways to Step Back in Time in New York State</title>
      <link>http://www.iloveny.com/blog/post/new-york-state-places-to-step-back-in-time/</link>
      <description>Travel back to the past in New York State! Whether you prefer to walk the halls of dazzling Gold Coast estates on Long Island, fly in a real vintage biplane over the Hudson Valley, or explore the historic homes of equal rights leaders in the Finger Lakes, there are all kinds of ways to experience history. From presidential sites to historic country villages, read on to check out some of the state’s coolest places to step back in time.</description>
